      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey quick question—i have to go from tokyo to osaka then up to fukuoka next week for work. is it better to just stick to the shinkansen or should i look into domestic flights for those legs? trying to figure out what's actually faster when you factor in getting to the airports and stuff.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
