      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the breakdown. the train prices seem way better actually. one more thing though, i've heard people mention that things can sometimes go wrong with the schedule or luggage gets lost. is there anything else i should be careful of or watch out for when traveling between these cities? just want to avoid any weird issues.",
      "source": "evaluator"
